       01 WS-T-OUT           GLOBAL PIC 9(9).
       01 WS-RANDOM          GLOBAL PIC 9V9(6).
       01 WS-ROLES-SEEN      GLOBAL PIC X VALUE "N".
      *>   The topic's registered data files (R20-R25), by the name each was
